        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 31f14986-58f0-4292-ba42-cedf4b51b615).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Sapienza, 47.\r\rA criminal crew known as The Three Luigis are planning a heist at Villa Caruso. Some of the staff however have grown wise to this ruse and have hired you to exorcise this trio from the mansion.\r\rOne is posing as a plumber to secure a covert escape route underground, one has infiltrated the security detail providing access to the most privileged areas of the house, and the third conspirator is currently headed downtown to arrange their getaway vehicle.\r\rHappy hunting.",
